# Manual postup-aktualizace-firmwaru, step 5 (base during a remote update) and step 7 failure text
tick 3000
key enter
event fw transfer 10
expect screen fwupdate
expect text Aktualizace
expect text Prenos do ovladace
event fw install 100
expect text Instalace ovladace
event fw error 100
expect text Chyba aktualizace
event fw_end
expect screen main
